    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add refined flour, almond flour, dry ginger powder, cinnamon powder, clove powder, baking soda, nutmeg powder, cocoa powder and give it a good mix.",
      "Add NestlÃ© MILKMAID mini, prepared wet mixture, oil, caramel colour, oil, orange juice and mix it well.",
      "Pour the mixture in a greased mold, place it in the steamer and steam it for 15-20 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Gently demold the pudding and leave it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan or saucepan, add tutti frutti, raisins, apricot, orange juice, a pinch of salt, butter and give it a quick boil.",
      "Keep it aside to cool down at room temperature.",
      "In a pan, add butter, sugar and let it cook for a while until sugar is caramelized.",
      "Add NestlÃ© MILKMAID mini, water and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add sugar, orange, cook it until sugar is caramelized and well coated.",
      "Transfer the oranges into the dish or tray and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add water, orange marmalade, a pinch of salt and give it a quick boil.",
      "Take the prepared puddings and prick with the help of a satay stick or toothpick.",
      "Pour the prepared syrup onto the pudding and leave it aside for further use.",
      "In a serving plate add prepared sauce and place the prepared pudding.",
      "Garnish it with candied cherries, caramelized orange, icing sugar and fresh mint sprig.",
      "Serve warm."
    ],
